{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7fd6e1842bf2632702e436d8a4cb218d23f39d14a7c72ff73647324b7b44970c", "ja": "（今日はこれから、\n奈緒の宣材写真を撮影だ）", "zh": "（今天接下来的时间\n要拍奈绪的宣传照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "8373843669a540f17fa9826d48fd847acaaad3a4f7a8437bbcb07358c60150de", "ja": "ひえ～～。\n撮影スタジオって、こんなに立派なんや……。", "zh": "呜哇～～\n原来摄影棚这么大间喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "24c9ab74d99d68c773128cd015c7dae780d02b272eef02034e9230a941d35417", "ja": "置いてあるカメラもメッチャ大きいし、\nスタッフさんも、なんやプロって感じが……。", "zh": "里面放的相机也好大一架，\n工作人员感觉也都好专业……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "3be267f05b781454dc93193a40b2ae7cf3ea29da58fe473f5ccca3ab0ae8bc07", "ja": "あ、アカン、緊張してきたっ。\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょ？", "zh": "啊，糟糕，我开始紧张了啦。\n{$P$}先生，怎么办啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7a15a5d6aa25f77789a8207261c092d00ef9083a2af642bc7bb391e864aeba15", "ja": "どうもこうも、まずは写真を撮る準備かな。\nとりあえず、メイクさんの所に行こうか。", "zh": "还能怎么办呢？先从拍照前的准备开始吧。\n总之，先去找化妆师吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "678ea82227ae085e9ee618ad29b9b4750f7925e121f4b2acc0389f87def526ab", "ja": "め、メイクさん……プロの響きやわ……。", "zh": "化、化妆师……听起来好专业……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "94042fc199cb137293077b5499e20d53ac3f1b8760c2cd17fac1c10a81662daf", "ja": "まあ、プロだからな。", "zh": "嗯，本来就是专业的没错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "0270cec16e17f3cb80c19796174a319db8907f583072e62f4719955472f9bda4", "ja": "ちなみに、{$P$}さん。\nこれから撮る写真って、何に使うんですか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生。\n接下来拍的照片是要干嘛用的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cb065e3b7a3578b2717efd3dcda0850bcab159fa79a0cb949cf61c117c0f56dd", "ja": "これから撮るのは、宣材写真。\nまあ、業界の色々な人達に配るのに使うかな。", "zh": "接下来要拍的是宣传照。\n这个宣传照呢，就是要拿去发给圈内人士用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ae9e7b1a59b8205e092e0dd66ebf742e16a3977ed4b2ee2e0d07dc4faa70ac61", "ja": "配る！？\nわ、私の写真をですか！？", "zh": "要发出去！？\n我、我的照片吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "958cb868723ac9aec9b448bf84f50c27c1f52178468a0d0d51090cbfd935dadf", "ja": "そうだよ。仕事を取るためには、\nまずみんなに奈緒を知ってもらう必要があるから。", "zh": "对啊。为了拿到工作邀约，\n首先要让各方人士认识奈绪啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "a30ab47fa3e498163e8ff19e244cb6e7e93e133734f392fb7a28d92638273a83", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか。\nお仕事をもらうために……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样吗？\n为了拿到工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4e7a81691e5f733ec7d271517e49bfaf70459e8988dde5c4b70c55b17b072d6b", "ja": "アイドルなら、普通のことだけど……\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "对偶像来说，这是很正常的事……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "0a72b9332a5a5c4595ed9f617ad63ecf75f37a497d455a6e55bba69aee85a6e7", "ja": "いや～。\nお仕事をもらうのに、業界中に配るって聞くと……。", "zh": "不是啦～\n我听到为了工作要把照片在圈内四处发……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "d097afb1d5b86a7f0643ca6af6137b7f5708f98bf834fa50289fb626bceffed6", "ja": "なんや、話が大きなってきたな～と思って……。\nあはは……。", "zh": "就觉得整个规模好庞大喔……\n哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "77210aa6ad1f3a868ec9718aacfe412baf7a1ba6e63f8921c2f97515211ba3b4", "ja": "あれ。もしかして……\n今さら怖気づいたのか？", "zh": "咦？你该不会……\n临阵畏缩了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "5a302cc8e315eae70fe084b499877f2dbb370528e1630ef3036f7616c79c129e", "ja": "お、怖気づいてませんー！\nただ、ちょっと緊張しただけで……。", "zh": "我、我才没有畏缩吼～！\n我只是、有点紧张罢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "df74c71cc94be971a49077c887c0befa3a7a2f6a023d0f6da2ec2fd398324dca", "ja": "だって私、ついこないだまで普通の女子高生ですよ？\nちょっとはビビりますって！", "zh": "因为我不久之前还是个普通的女高中生啊。\n会有点吓到也不为过吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7ef30cf1dcdefd3ea1d471a527137f589bbd29209eb057e5349f415386747f84", "ja": "……それもそうか。宣材写真を撮るってことは、\n自分はアイドルだと業界に宣言することと同じだし。", "zh": "……这么说也是。毕竟拍宣传照就等于是\n向演艺圈宣告自己成为偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "14746076a023f4431eb2dc285ef217de16b46c39e030177c5270e9cd2cad3a45", "ja": "業界にアイドル宣言……。\nアカン……ますます緊張してきた……。", "zh": "向演艺圈宣告自己是偶像……\n不行啦……我越来越紧张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "bf59bd51b26a75e4660e29f66209d5977ddf1e366d1c8260170eb87743e78034", "ja": "う～～もう！　プロデューサーさんのクセに、\n新人アイドル追いつめてどないするんですかっ！", "zh": "呜～～真是的！制作人先生，你怎么这样！\n怎么可以给新人偶像压力呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "21fc1f350a4f27ecdf3b255ad2acc3c6d7860cf2f73b4d83f5d4cee45a07e0b2", "ja": "ごめんごめん。でも、大事な一歩だからこそ、\n奈緒には笑顔で踏み出してほしいんだけど。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。不过，也正因为这是很重要的一步，\n所以奈绪，我希望你可以带着笑容踏出这一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "cd001f88e3521f862573e04bdf0a47b996c9bfbace9413aea25be999f8c67aa2", "ja": "笑顔で……？", "zh": "带着笑容……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5defda7aff5316975b709f320b6ae7a0725d664058a252d7ad9f2f714982a948", "ja": "いつでも元気で笑顔なのが、\n奈緒の一番の魅力だと思う。だから……。", "zh": "我认为活力常驻的笑容\n就是奈绪你最大的魅力。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9f3c569ac9837a36551393c0e6be9afc957a413fd5e9586b972dd7aff0b1dd09", "ja": "奈緒がアイドルを楽しんで、最高の笑顔になっている\nところを、みんなに見せてあげてほしいんだ。", "zh": "我希望让所有人看到你享受当偶像，\n展露灿烂笑容的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "fb5740d5db9b8197236620796be367fc9dcf0c986033cf3fb918820794301ac4", "ja": "私が、アイドルを楽しんでるところ……？", "zh": "我享受当偶像的模样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b8d68d37bf8d9c0aed32a100c164ad427bfdd2798ec24908fba3dee59403ee3b", "ja": "ああ。だって、人生は1度きり、だろ？", "zh": "没错。你不是说人生只有一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "d15341754496e25b2a9f9433bf3dc9e6935a7e62386108800da6e967df6b6d42", "ja": "あ。ちょっとー、プロデューサーさんのくせに、\nアイドルの台詞、取らんといてもらえます？", "zh": "啊，喂～我说制作人先生啊，\n你可以不要偷学人家偶像的台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a13d6dd6432e798cf6a9997593436e41574a61f9d7cc8859637e156ad10c6cd3", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\nいい台詞だったもんだから、つい。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n因为你讲得很棒嘛，我不小心就学起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "0b717097eb4f31c31dc63a2431c09584c9f46327e89e34f1403dd6f75c18cb6f", "ja": "えへへ、そうでしょ？\n自分でもそう思いますもん。", "zh": "嘿嘿，很棒吼？\n我自己也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "53663547201697e57fb0c29f3350534ea35bab80d7d2f0208cac41058cfc5357", "ja": "でも……そうそう。人生は1度きり、でした！", "zh": "不过……你说得对。人生只有一次，没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "4eb070323e1e2fc6e1f5a1de827fefe17aa2153feb248e6250eb86d375135021", "ja": "私、これから憧れのアイドルになれるんや。\n緊張なんかしてたら、メッチャ損やんな！", "zh": "我接下来就要成为向往的偶像啦。\n在这边瞎紧张就太浪费时间啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "bc7d9cf0925d9fcb264d41511e7d85480d6d305918b1081a20a795538ead0299", "ja": "そういうことだ。\n1度きりの人生、思いっきり楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "就是这样。\n人生只有一次，尽情去享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "2ab1aae1a2a3e2dd287c8d27f46324885f36334beff8e34a9a61a57dfe267b54", "ja": "はいっ！　なんや、元気になってきました！\n{$P$}さんは敏腕やな～。", "zh": "好的！我感觉有精神多了！\n{$P$}先生真是有一手啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "09e0f4826ae6a9e2d330f79fc42050feb4862acbf1f05c1ff2d636c6bf8f8a52", "ja": "よっしゃ！　横山奈緒、いってきます！\nアイドル、メッチャ楽しんできますわ～！", "zh": "好！横山奈绪，要出发了！\n我这就去好好享受偶像人生啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1035_p", "source_sha256": "52026b88a0f86b28585acb4c4c497148ce22bc860b16b312b278993881c5fc9e", "ja": "ああ、頑張れよ！", "zh": "去吧，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1036_p", "source_sha256": "22027a82ab56f7e677372b640b8db5a2447d8dedbdf647ac8cb7b6446477673b", "ja": "（その後、持ち前の明るさを取り戻した奈緒は、\n順調に撮影をこなした！）", "zh": "（之后，恢复以往开朗的奈绪\n顺利地拍完照了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "cc13fe4e8e8aecad2fe962f5fcc055c5204041f57739c671d18d30c104b11cbb", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　見てこの写真！\nとびっきりの笑顔ですよ～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！你看看这张照片！\n这笑容很棒吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "96a5e6380bf739575c31cc2fd45f374a61a38e026fa04bebe137b53a7d2f5562", "ja": "どうです？　私、アイドルっぽいですか？", "zh": "怎么样？我看起来像个偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3af5388485f4f5bafb1173d472cef99b4783fbbee5c87ce8857f0cd1c0f40660", "ja": "ああ、ばっちりだ！\nすごくいい写真だぞ！", "zh": "很好，非常完美！\n这照片很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_002_1040_p", "source_sha256": "254ecda083d992886132131058a3d5d20e04093932cebcbb8a7253cc3bb17cae", "ja": "（やっぱり奈緒の笑顔は魅力的だ。これからもアイドル\nを楽しめるように、サポートしていかないとな！）", "zh": "（奈绪的笑容果然非常有魅力。\n今后我得好好协助她，让她能继续享受偶像人生！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
